    <MESSAGE value="feat(scripts): enable detached updates for AuditReady agents across platforms&#10;&#10;Ensure update scripts for macOS, Windows, and Linux re-launch in detached mode when initiated by a running AuditReady agent. This prevents update interruptions caused by the update process stopping the agent mid-update. Logs are redirected to dedicated update log files for each platform." />
